---

## Lessons Learned

This sprint demonstrated how enterprise organizations establish security visibility before deploying a SIEM.

Rather than collecting default Windows logs alone, enterprise environments enhance telemetry using:

- Group Policy
- Advanced Windows Auditing
- PowerShell Logging
- Sysmon

This approach provides significantly richer forensic data for threat hunting, incident response, and detection engineering.

